window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v26-010-c8b55770975c4e1d.json"]={sha256:"c8b55770975c4e1dbeb416773b34f309e82afb79c8383fab736555123c1a5786",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v26-case-35086add5bc55071","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7644.html","title":"RFC 7644: SCIM Protocol","titleEn":"RFC 7644: SCIM Protocol","publisher":"IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v26-010","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v26-010","related":[{"id":"security-v26-011","referenceUrls":["https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5280.html"],"title":"X.509 信任鏈：名稱限制與有效期交集","titleEn":"X.509 paths: name constraints and validity intersections","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：重播無重複資源，17與10分鐘上限假設完整；停用與session撤銷的測試結果分開呈現。 交付去識別化身分關聯表、冪等測試與端到端停權時間線。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Replays create no duplicate resources, assumptions for 17 and 10 minutes are explicit, and disablement is reported separately from session revocation. Deliver pseudonymous identity mappings, idempotency tests and an end-to-end deprovisioning timeline.","difference":"為虛構校園CA畫出根、簽發CA與服務憑證；逐層標示basicConstraints、keyUsage、名稱限制與用途，不把鏈存在當驗證成功。","differenceEn":"Draw a fictional campus root, issuing CA and service certificate; annotate basicConstraints, keyUsage, name constraints and purpose at each layer without treating chain presence as validation success.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["串行最壞停權延遲=來源偵測等待+同步排程等待+目標套用時間；這是所設教學流程的上限，不是SCIM協定保證。 來源最多5分鐘偵測、同步最多10分鐘等待、目標2分鐘套用；假設三階段串行且無重試。 最壞延遲5+10+2=17分鐘；同步等待縮為3分鐘後為10分鐘。","教學時間交集取max(notBefore)到min(notAfter)，但名稱、用途、簽章與可信錨仍須獨立通過。 葉憑證有效日10至90，簽發CA有效日0至100；信任錨已由另一步驗證，本題採半開區間。 交集長度min(90,100)−max(10,0)=80日；葉憑證終日改70時為60日。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Serial worst-case deprovisioning delay is source detection wait plus sync wait plus target application time; it bounds this teaching workflow, not SCIM itself. Detection waits at most 5 minutes, sync waits 10 and target application takes 2; assume serial stages without retries. Worst-case delay is 5+10+2=17 minutes; reducing sync wait to 3 yields 10 minutes.","The teaching validity intersection runs from max(notBefore) to min(notAfter); names, purpose, signatures and trust anchors still require separate checks. Leaf validity is days 10–90 and issuing-CA validity 0–100; the trust anchor is established separately and intervals are half-open for this exercise. Intersection length is min(90,100)−max(10,0)=80 days; changing leaf end to 70 gives 60 days.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v26-020","referenceUrls":["https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8915.html","https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5905.html"],"title":"Network Time Security：可信時間與偏移誤差","titleEn":"Network Time Security: authenticated time and offset error","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：重播無重複資源，17與10分鐘上限假設完整；停用與session撤銷的測試結果分開呈現。 交付去識別化身分關聯表、冪等測試與端到端停權時間線。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Replays create no duplicate resources, assumptions for 17 and 10 minutes are explicit, and disablement is reported separately from session revocation. Deliver pseudonymous identity mappings, idempotency tests and an end-to-end deprovisioning timeline.","difference":"畫出NTS-KE與後續NTP兩階段，區分cookie、認證結果與時鐘偏移；使用合成四時間戳，不修改正在使用的電腦時鐘。","differenceEn":"Diagram NTS-KE and later NTP exchanges, separating cookies, authentication and clock offset; use synthetic four-timestamp records without changing a working computer clock.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["串行最壞停權延遲=來源偵測等待+同步排程等待+目標套用時間；這是所設教學流程的上限，不是SCIM協定保證。 來源最多5分鐘偵測、同步最多10分鐘等待、目標2分鐘套用；假設三階段串行且無重試。 最壞延遲5+10+2=17分鐘；同步等待縮為3分鐘後為10分鐘。","NTP偏移估計θ=((t2−t1)+(t3−t4))/2；認證能驗證對端，不能自動消除網路非對稱延遲。 四個合成時間戳以毫秒表示：t1=1000、t2=1018、t3=1022、t4=1028。 θ=(18−6)/2=6毫秒；若t4改1032，其餘不變，θ=(18−10)/2=4毫秒。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Serial worst-case deprovisioning delay is source detection wait plus sync wait plus target application time; it bounds this teaching workflow, not SCIM itself. Detection waits at most 5 minutes, sync waits 10 and target application takes 2; assume serial stages without retries. Worst-case delay is 5+10+2=17 minutes; reducing sync wait to 3 yields 10 minutes.","NTP offset estimate is θ=((t2−t1)+(t3−t4))/2; authentication validates the peer but does not eliminate asymmetric network delay. Four synthetic timestamps in milliseconds are t1=1000, t2=1018, t3=1022 and t4=1028. θ=(18−6)/2=6 ms; changing only t4 to 1032 gives θ=(18−10)/2=4 ms.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v26-case-7e022b9f7d9ff2bc","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5280.html","title":"RFC 5280: X.509 Certificate and CRL Profile","titleEn":"RFC 5280: X.509 Certificate and CRL Profile","publisher":"IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-2144ce5d0b000796","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8915.html","title":"RFC 8915: Network Time Security","titleEn":"RFC 8915: Network Time Security","publisher":"IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-1a39d3e263dbfbc4","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5905.html","title":"RFC 5905: NTPv4 protocol and algorithms","titleEn":"RFC 5905: NTPv4 protocol and algorithms","publisher":"IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
